<title>CROATIA: Croatia c.bank sells HRK 64 mln bills, rate flat.</title>
<headline>Croatia c.bank sells HRK 64 mln bills, rate flat.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatian central bank sold 64 million kuna worth of 35-day bills at a regular auction on Wednesday, down from 166 million kuna last week.</p>
<p>The rate was flat at 8.0 percent, compared with 11 percent paid lately for the Finance Ministry's 35-day treasury bills.</p>
<p>There were no bids for 91- and 182-day bills.</p>
<p>-- Davor Huic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
